   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Containers and packaging when shopping",
     "texto": [
      "In German, precise terms are used to specify the container of a food or drink:",
      "1. **die Flasche** (bottle): **eine Flasche Wasser**, **zwei Flaschen Saft**.",
      "2. **die Packung** (package): **eine Packung Reis**, **eine Packung Tee**.",
      "3. **die Dose** (can): **eine Dose Tomaten**, **eine Dose Fisch**.",
      "4. **das Glas** (jar / glass / glass jar): **ein Glas Marmelade**, **ein Glas Honig**.",
      "5. **das Stück** (piece): **ein Stück Käse**, **ein Stück Kuchen**.",
      "6. **der Becher** (tub, yogurt pot): **ein Becher Joghurt**.",
      "**Key rule:** Unlike English («a bottle of water»), in German **no preposition is used** between the container and the substance: **eine Flasche Wasser**, **ein Kilo Tomaten**, **ein Stück Käse**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
